en_gloss":"[the] women","transliteration":"l-nisāa","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"during","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْمَحِيضِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(their) [the] menstruation","transliteration":"l-maḥīḍi","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And (do) not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَقْرَبُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"approach them","transliteration":"taqrabūhunna","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":13,"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَطْهُرْنَ ۖ","en_gloss":"they are cleansed","transliteration":"yaṭhur'na","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَإِذَا","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تَطَهَّرْنَ","en_gloss":"they are purified","transliteration":"taṭahharna","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَأْتُوهُنَّ","en_gloss":"then come to them","transliteration":"fatūhunna","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":19,"ar":"حَيْثُ","en_gloss":"where","transliteration":"ḥaythu","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":20,"ar":"أَمَرَكُمُ","en_gloss":"has ordered you","transliteration":"amarakumu","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":22,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":23,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":24,"ar":"يُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"loves","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":25,"ar":"ٱلتَّوَّٰبِينَ","en_gloss":"those who turn in repentance","transliteration":"l-tawābīna","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":26,"ar":"وَيُحِبُّ","en_gloss":"and loves","transliteration":"wayuḥibbu","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":27,"ar":"ٱلْمُتَطَهِّرِينَ","en_gloss":"those who purify themselves","transliteration":"l-mutaṭahirīna","verse_key":"2:222"},{"pos":28,"ar":"٢٢٢","en_gloss":"(222)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:222"}]},{"verse_key":"2:223","surah":2,"ayah":223,"ar_uthmani":"نِسَآؤُكُمْ حَرْثٌ لَّكُمْ فَأْتُوا۟ حَرْثَكُمْ أَنَّىٰ شِئْتُمْ ۖ وَقَدِّمُوا۟ لِأَنفُسِكُمْ ۚ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟ أَنَّكُم مُّلَـٰقُوهُ ۗ وَبَشِّرِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your wives are your fields, so go into your fields whichever way you like,and send [something good] ahead for yourselves. Be mindful of God: remember that you will meet Him.’ [Prophet], give good news to the believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"نِسَآؤُكُمْ","en_gloss":"Your wives","transliteration":"nisāukum","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَرْثٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) a tilth","transliteration":"ḥarthun","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فَأْتُوا۟","en_gloss":"so come","transliteration":"fatū","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَرْثَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(to) your tilth","transliteration":"ḥarthakum","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنَّىٰ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"annā","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":7,"ar":"شِئْتُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"you wish","transliteration":"shi'tum","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَقَدِّمُوا۟","en_gloss":"and send forth (good deeds)","transliteration":"waqaddimū","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لِأَنفُسِكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"for yourselves","transliteration":"li-anfusikum","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"And be conscious","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and know","transliteration":"wa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":13,"ar":"أَنَّكُم","en_gloss":"that you","transliteration":"annakum","verse_key":"2:223"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّلَـٰقُوهُ ۗ","en_gloss":"(will) meet Him","transliteratio